SIR,
LET ME GET THIS STRAIGHT.

41
00:01:58,118 --> 00:02:00,120
THE VICTIM'S WIFE
IS DONNA HINES,

42
00:02:00,120 --> 00:02:02,209
AND IT WAS
HER BROTHER ROD GERBER

43
