THAT TOLD YOU TO STEP BACK.
IS THAT RIGHT?

44
00:02:04,646 --> 00:02:06,648
MY NAME IS THEODORE LUSCOM.

45
00:02:06,648 --> 00:02:09,129
I AM A CITIZEN
OF FREE CALIFORNIA.

46
00:02:09,129 --> 00:02:12,349
THE SO-CALLED FEDERAL AND STATE
AUTHORITIES YOU WORK FOR

47
00:02:12,349 --> 00:02:14,351
ARE NOT LEGITIMATE.

48
00:02:14,351 --> 00:02:16,353
THEREFORE, I DO NOT
RECOGNIZE YOUR RIGHT

49
00:02:16,353 --> 00:02:18,355
