WHO WE'RE WORKING FOR.

56
00:02:33,283 --> 00:02:37,200
THAT, MY FRIEND, WAS
AN EYE-OPENER, I TELL YOU. WOW.ARE YOU MOCKING ME?

57
00:02:37,200 --> 00:02:40,464
OH, I'M SERIOUS. THEY TOLD US...
[whispers] THE WHOLE GRAND PLAN.

58
00:02:40,464 --> 00:02:43,206
HUSH.
IGNORE HIM, MR. LUSCOM.

59
00:02:43,206 --> 00:02:45,208
GOOD STUFF.

60
00:02:45,208 --> 00:02:47,210
[engine starts]

61
00:02:47,210 --> 00:02:49,081
JUST IGNORE ME.

62
00:02:55,305 --> 00:02:57,655
LISBON?HEY, BOSCO. WHAT'S UP?

63
00:02:57,655 --> 00:02:59,918
YOU'RE NOT GONNA LIKE
WHAT I'M ABOUT TO DO,

64
00:02:59,918 --> 00:03:02,443
BUT YOU'RE GONNA HAVE
TO DEAL WITH IT.[Lisbon] WHAT?

65
00:03:02,443 --> 00:03:05,402
HEY, BOSCO.HI, JANE. YOU'RE UNDER ARREST.

66
00:03:05,402 --> 00:03:07,883
HMM?

67
00:03:11,539 --> 00:03:20,287
♪♪

68
00:03:20,287 --> 00:03:23,072
IT'S A MICROPHONE TRANSMITTER

69
00:03:23,072 --> 00:03:25,509
LOCATED DURING AN ELECTRONIC
SWEEP OF OUR OFFICES.

70
00:03:25,509 --> 00:03:28,686
THAT IS A DEDICATED RECEIVER
TO THE UNIT

71
00:03:28,686 --> 00:03:32,951
WHICH I FOUND IN JANE'S DESK.IS THIS TRUE, JANE? YOU WERE
SPYING ON BOSCO AND HIS TEAM?

72
00:03:32,951 --> 00:03:35,040
"SPYING" IS
SUCH AN UGLY WORD.

73
00:03:35,040 --> 00:03:38,174
MORE JUST KEEPING
A FRIENDLY EYE ON THINGS.

74
00:03:38,174 --> 00:03:40,698
DID YOU KNOW ABOUT THIS?OF COURSE NOT. I WOULD HAVE
NEVER ALLOWED THIS.

75
00:03:40,698 --> 00:03:42,265
SHE WOULD NEVER.

76
00:03:42,265 --> 00:03:44,572
YOU UNDERSTAND THIS IS
A SERIOUS CRIMINAL OFFENSE?

77
00:03:44,572 --> 00:03:46,182
COME ON.

78
00:03:46,182 --> 00:03:48,228
EAVESDROPPING IS A FELONY

79
00:03:48,228 --> 00:03:50,839
UNDER SECTION 632
OF THE PENAL CODE,

80
00:03:50,839 --> 00:03:54,016
PUNISHABLE BY UP TO ONE YEAR
IN PRISON.HOW COULD YOU BE SO STUPID?

81
00:03:56,105 --> 00:03:59,108
HE HAS THE RED JOHN CASE.
HE WON'T KEEP ME INFORMED.

82
00:03:59,108 --> 00:04:02,198
SO I HAVE TO
KEEP MYSELF INFORMED.

83
00:04:02,198 --> 00:04:05,680
I WAS LOW-KEY ABOUT IT. I COULD
HAVE TURNED ONE OF HIS AGENTS

84
00:04:05,680 --> 00:04:09,118
OR USED BLACKMAIL OR BRIBERY.
I DIDN'T.

85
00:04:09,118 --> 00:04:12,077
WELL, THANKS FOR YOUR RESTRAINT.
WE CAN RESOLVE THIS EASILY.

86
00:04:12,077 --> 00:04:14,079
IT'S YOUR CHOICE.

87
00:04:14,079 --> 00:04:16,647
HOW'S THAT?

88
00:04:16,647 --> 00:04:19,259
IF JANE RESIGNS IMMEDIATELY

89
00:04:19,259 --> 00:04:22,044
AND AGREES TO NEVER RETURN
TO THE CBI,

90
00:04:22,044 --> 00:04:25,439
I WILL ASK THE A.G.
NOT TO FILE CHARGES.

91
00:04:25,439 --> 00:04:27,179
BOSS.

92
00:04:27,179 --> 00:04:30,139
YOU KNOW BOSCO HAS THE RIGHT
OF IT. NOTHING I CAN DO.

93
00:04:30,139 --> 00:04:34,186
NOTHING I WANT TO DO, FRANKLY.
HE CROSSED A LINE.

94
00:04:34,186 --> 00:04:36,754
WHAT'S IT GONNA BE, JANE?

95
00:04:36,754 --> 00:04:39,757
CHARGE ME.

96
00:04:39,757 --> 00:04:42,194
I'LL SEE YOU IN COURT.

97
00:04:42,194 --> 00:04:45,197
I'M NOT GONNA LEAVE THE CBI
JUST 'CAUSE YOU TELL ME TO.

98
00:04:45,197 --> 00:04:49,245
IF I CHARGE YOU,
YOU'LL GO TO JAIL NOW--TODAY--

99
00:04:49,245 --> 00:04:51,987
