FOR BAIL TILL TUESDAY.

100
00:04:51,987 --> 00:04:55,251
SO THAT'S THREE DAYS
AND NIGHTS IN JAIL.IT'S A NEW EXPERIENCE.
I WELCOME IT.

101
00:04:55,251 --> 00:04:57,514
DON'T BE STUPID.
THIS IS SERIOUS.

102
00:04:57,514 --> 00:05:00,125
COME ON, SAM.
YOU REALLY WANT TO DO THIS?

103
00:05:00,125 --> 00:05:01,997
I JUST DID. MALLOY!

104
00:05:01,997 --> 00:05:04,173
HE'S READY TO GO.

105
