[man] HEY, GUYS.

109
00:05:34,421 --> 00:05:37,075
[door closes]HEY, PETE.

110
00:05:37,075 --> 00:05:39,991
DID YOU SEE ANY VERMIN
OUT IN THE CORRIDOR THERE?VERMIN?

111
00:05:39,991 --> 00:05:41,210
MICE.

112
00:05:41,210 --> 00:05:42,646
NUH-UNH.

113
00:05:42,646 --> 00:05:44,953
SEE? TOLD YOU.
YOU'RE PARANOID, MAN.

114
00:05:44,953 --> 00:05:48,086
I KNOW WHAT I SAW.
I KNOW WHAT I SAW.

115
