PROTECTIVE CUSTODY FOR, THEN?

119
00:05:58,488 --> 00:06:01,535
WELL, I GUESS I DON'T.

120
00:06:01,535 --> 00:06:03,058
YOUR FUNERAL.

121
00:06:06,278 --> 00:06:09,194
[bell rings]

122
00:06:16,114 --> 00:06:17,986
[indistinct conversations]

123
