125
00:06:38,615 --> 00:06:41,009
[metal door clanks]

126
00:06:46,536 --> 00:06:48,495
[man speaking indistinctly]

127
00:06:53,282 --> 00:06:54,936
[clank]

128
00:06:57,199 --> 00:06:59,070
UH...

129
00:06:59,070 --> 00:07:00,942
HI. NICE TO MEET YOU.

130
00:07:03,161 --> 00:07:05,773
