THEY SAY I RAPED AND MURDERED
A GUY, STABBED HIM TO DEATH.

134
00:07:17,219 --> 00:07:18,699
OH.

135
00:07:18,699 --> 00:07:21,441
BUT IT'S NOT TRUE.OH, THAT'S GOOD.

136
00:07:21,441 --> 00:07:25,967
WE HAD CONSENSUAL SEX.
THENI STABBED HIM TO DEATH.

137
00:07:25,967 --> 00:07:27,185
OKAY.

138
00:07:27,185 --> 00:07:29,057
YOU GET THE TOP BUNK.

139
00:07:31,059 --> 00:07:33,017
I LIKE THE TOP BUNK.

140
00:07:33,017 --> 00:07:35,629
[mutters]

141
