BUT JANE WAS BOUND TO
SELF-DESTRUCT EVENTUALLY.

143
00:07:40,460 --> 00:07:43,419
WE ALL KNEW THAT.BUT, BOSS, COME ON.
THERE MUST BE SOMETHING--

144
00:07:43,419 --> 00:07:46,204
LET'S GET BACK TO THE CASE,
SHALL WE?

145
00:07:46,204 --> 00:07:49,120
IS THAT THE BOOK WE FOUND
ON THE VICTIM?YEAH, KIRBY WOULDN'T WIN
ANY PENMANSHIP AWARDS.

146
00:07:49,120 --> 00:07:51,471
IT'S MOSTLY ILLEGIBLE.LOTS OF NUMBERS. TIMES, MAYBE?

147
00:07:51,471 --> 00:07:53,777
MAP COORDINATES.
BIBLE CITATIONS.

148
00:07:53,777 --> 00:07:58,260
THERE'S A FEW NAMES
I CAN MAKE OUT--JAY, MARTIN.

149
00:07:58,260 --> 00:08:00,131
AND THEN ON THIS PAGE...

150
00:08:00,131 --> 00:08:02,177
"VULTURES!!!"?

151
