SOMEBODY'S PREYING ON HIM,
WAITING FOR HIM TO DIE?

152
00:08:04,484 --> 00:08:07,269
PREYING ON HIM FOR WHAT, THOUGH?
HE WASN'T A RICH MAN.

153
00:08:07,269 --> 00:08:09,663
CHO, GET TO WORK ON TED LUSCOM.
VAN PELT AND I ARE GONNA GO

154
00:08:09,663 --> 00:08:11,491
TALK TO KIRBY'S FAMILY
IN THE MORNING.

155
00:08:11,491 --> 00:08:14,189
RIGSBY, GET ON THE HINESES.[Rigsby] OKAY, YOU GOT IT.

156
00:08:19,281 --> 00:08:22,937
SO, TED,
TELL US ABOUT YOUR BEEF

157
00:08:22,937 --> 00:08:24,852
WITH KIRBY HINES
AND THE GERBERS.

158
00:08:24,852 --> 00:08:28,116
I GET TO CALL YOU
BY YOUR FIRST NAME, TOO?

159
00:08:28,116 --> 00:08:29,944
IF YOU LIKE. I'M KIMBALL.

160
00:08:29,944 --> 00:08:33,861
[chuckles] AIN'T YOU SMOOTH
AND EASYGOING?

161
00:08:33,861 --> 00:08:37,212
[exhales]

162
00:08:37,212 --> 00:08:39,910
THAT 10 ACRES
WHERE KIRBY DIED--

163
00:08:39,910 --> 00:08:44,175
THAT WAS
MY GRANDFATHER'S LAND.

164
00:08:44,175 --> 00:08:48,179
20 YEARS BACK, MY FATHER'S
BROTHER ROY STOLE IT

165
00:08:48,179 --> 00:08:50,181
FROM US RIGHTFUL PROGENY

166
00:08:50,181 --> 00:08:53,707
AND FRAUDULENTLY SOLD IT
TO THE GERBERS, WHO KNEW.

167
00:08:53,707 --> 00:08:55,752
THE GERBERS
KNEW HE STOLE IT.

168
00:08:55,752 --> 00:08:59,060
AND HOW MUCH IS 10 ACRES
OF LAND WORTH AROUND THERE?

169
00:08:59,060 --> 00:09:01,062
OH, HELL, MAN.
IT AIN'T THE LAND.

170
00:09:01,062 --> 00:09:03,064
IT'S WHAT'S UNDER IT--
OIL SANDS.

171
