00:23:00,248 --> 00:23:03,033
But, hey, no point in arguing
over the phone.

443
00:23:03,033 --> 00:23:05,384
WE'LL SORT THIS OUT WHEN
I GET OUT TO YOUR LOCATION.

444
00:23:05,384 --> 00:23:08,778
SEMPER FI, SISSY BRITCHES.

445
00:23:13,392 --> 00:23:15,481
[engine turns off]

446
00:23:17,700 --> 00:23:21,312
RODDY GERBER?
AGENT RIGSBY, CBI.

447
00:23:28,363 --> 00:23:30,278
[buzzer sounds]

448
00:23:35,762 --> 00:23:39,330
RODDY.

449
00:23:39,330 --> 00:23:41,768
HEY, THANK YOU SO MUCH
FOR COMING.

450
00:23:43,552 --> 00:23:46,250
[chuckles]

451
00:23:48,601 --> 00:23:50,690
[dominoes click]

452
00:23:50,690 --> 00:23:52,735
SO, RODDY,
TELL ME ABOUT THE VULTURES.

453
00:23:52,735 --> 00:23:54,911
I DON'T KNOW WHAT
YOU'RE TALKING ABOUT.

454
00:23:54,911 --> 00:23:56,913
SURE YOU DO.

455
00:23:56,913 --> 00:23:59,220
I DON'T LIKE YOUR TONE.

456
00:23:59,220 --> 00:24:02,484
MAN, WE TALKING
OR WE PLAYING? COME ON.

457
00:24:02,484 --> 00:24:05,444
KIRBY FOUND TURKEY VULTURES
NESTING ON YOUR LAND, DIDN'T HE?

458
00:24:05,444 --> 00:24:07,271
NO, HE DIDN'T.

459
00:24:07,271 --> 00:24:11,319
TURKEY VULTURES ARE DYING OUT
BECAUSE OF A LOSS OF HABITAT.

460
00:24:11,319 --> 00:24:13,147
THEY'RE A PROTECTED SPECIES.

461
00:24:13,147 --> 00:24:15,192
IS THAT RIGHT?

462
00:24:15,192 --> 00:24:16,890
YEAH, IT IS.SERIOUSLY NOW, YOU'RE
DISRESPECTING THE GAME.

463
00:24:16,890 --> 00:24:18,457
[click]

464
00:24:18,457 --> 00:24:21,329
THANK YOU.ONE MOMENT. THEY'RE PROTECTED,

465
00:24:21,329 --> 00:24:23,766
WHICH MEANS IF THEY'RE
NESTING ON YOUR LAND,

466
00:24:23,766 --> 00:24:27,378
YOU CAN'T DRILL FOR THE OIL,
AND YOU DON'T GET RICH.

467
00:24:27,378 --> 00:24:29,206
[click]THAT RIGHT?

468
00:24:29,206 --> 00:24:30,773
YES, IT IS.

469
00:24:30,773 --> 00:24:32,645
SO WHEN KIRBY
TELLS YOU ABOUT THE NEST,

470
00:24:32,645 --> 00:24:34,864
YOU TELL KIRBY TO SHOW YOU
WHERE THE NEST IS

471
00:24:34,864 --> 00:24:36,866
SO THAT YOU CAN DESTROY IT.NO.

472
00:24:36,866 --> 00:24:39,913
ONLY KIRBY DOESN'T WANT TO TELL
YOU, SO YOU BEAT HIM UP A LITTLE

473
00:24:39,913 --> 00:24:42,785
UNTIL HE DOES TELL YOU.
THEN YOU GO AND YOU SHOOT

474
00:24:42,785 --> 00:24:45,179
THE VULTURES,
AND YOU DESTROY THE NEST.NO.

475
00:24:45,179 --> 00:24:47,311
BAD LUCK TO KILL LARGE BIRDS
UNLESS YOU EAT 'EM.

476
00:24:47,311 --> 00:24:49,618
YOU DIDN'T EAT 'EM, DID YOU?HELL NO!

477
00:24:49,618 --> 00:24:53,274
HA! BUT YOU ADMIT
YOU SHOT 'EM, THOUGH.THEY'RE VULTURES, MAN!

478
00:24:53,274 --> 00:24:55,494
YOU THINK I'M GONNA GIVE UP
A MILLION BUCKS

479
00:24:55,494 --> 00:24:58,148
OVER A COUPLE UGLY MOTHERS
WHO EAT DEAD PEOPLE?

480
00:24:58,148 --> 00:25:00,107
NO FRICKIN' WAY.

481
00:25:00,107 --> 00:25:02,109
SO YOU SHOT 'EM.

482
00:25:02,109 --> 00:25:04,241
YEAH, I DID.

483
00:25:04,241 --> 00:25:06,113
ANYBODY WOULD.

484
00:25:06,113 --> 00:25:07,941
I CAN'T DISAGREE.

485
00:25:07,941 --> 00:25:09,769
AND KIRBY?

486
00:25:09,769 --> 00:25:11,292
NO, NOT ME.

487
00:25:11,292 --> 00:25:15,339
I KICKED HIS ASS, YEAH.
I DIDN'T KILL HIM.

488
00:25:15,339 --> 00:25:18,473
NO NEED. WHAT THE HELL'S
HE GONNA DO TO ME?

489
00:25:18,473 --> 00:25:21,520
YOU SWEAR ON YOUR MOTHER'S GRAVE
YOU DIDN'T KILL KIRBY?

490
00:25:21,520 --> 00:25:26,481
I SWEAR ON MY MOM'S GRAVE
I DIDN'T KILL KIRBY.

491
00:25:28,178 --> 00:25:31,094
INTERESTING.

492
00:25:31,094 --> 00:25:34,228
NO, NO, NO. I THINK YOU SHOULD
TAKE LEAD. IT'S A FEMALE THING.

493
00:25:34,228 --> 00:25:37,187
NO, IT'S NOT. SHE'S FEMALE,
THAT'S ALL. HE'S NOT.

494
00:25:37,187 --> 00:25:39,842
YOU SHOULD TAKE LEAD.WHY ME?

495
00:25:39,842 --> 00:25:42,018
YOU'RE ALWAYS BEING,
YOU KNOW, TOO DIRECT.

496
00:25:42,018 --> 00:25:44,630
SHE WON'T BE OFFENDED.WHO WON'T BE OFFENDED?

497
00:25:44,630 --> 00:25:47,154
NOTHING. WELL...

498
00:25:47,154 --> 00:25:50,984
UH, WE WERE THINKING...

499
00:25:50,984 --> 00:25:53,856
THINKING'S GOOD.

500
00:25:53,856 --> 00:25:56,990
ABOUT?WE WENT TO BOSCO AND ASKED HIM
TO GIVE JANE A BREAK,

501
00:25:56,990 --> 00:25:59,253
BUT HE WOULDN'T.

502
00:25:59,253 --> 00:26:01,516
SO WE WERE THINKING MAYBE
IF YOU WENT AND ASKED BOSCO

503
00:26:01,516 --> 00:26:03,953
TO LET JANE GO
AS A PERSONAL FAVOR TO YOU,

504
00:26:03,953 --> 00:26:06,608
BETWEEN FRIENDS, HE'D DO IT.WHY WOULD YOU SAY THAT?

505
00:26:06,608 --> 00:26:09,306
WELL, YOU KNOW...IT'S OBVIOUS.

506
00:26:09,306 --> 00:26:11,221
HE HAS A THING FOR YOU--
SEXUAL THING.WE'RE NOT SAYING YOU HAD
AN AFFAIR OR ANYTHING,

507
00:26:11,221 --> 00:26:13,659
IT'S JUST THAT--HE LIKES YOU A LOT, IT SEEMS--

508
00:26:13,659 --> 00:26:16,444
THE WAY HE LOOKS
AT YOU SOMETIMES.

509
00:26:16,444 --> 00:26:20,056
YOU'RE MISTAKEN. BOSCO HAS
NO PARTICULAR LIKING FOR ME,

510
00:26:20,056 --> 00:26:23,016
AND EVEN IF HE DID, I WOULDN'T
USE IT AS LEVERAGE FOR JANE.

511
00:26:23,016 --> 00:26:26,149
WHY NOT?BECAUSE THE LAW IS THE LAW.

512
00:26:26,149 --> 00:26:29,370
JANE BROKE THE LAW, AND NOW HE'S
GOT TO PAY THE CONSEQUENCES.

513
00:26:29,370 --> 00:26:33,461
[cell phone rings]

514
00:26:33,461 --> 00:26:37,204
OH, HI, JANE.

515
00:26:37,204 --> 00:26:39,119
[sadly]
I NEED YOU TO COME VISIT ME.

516
00:26:39,119 --> 00:26:40,947
WHY? WE'RE BUSY.

517
00:26:40,947 --> 00:26:43,123
PLEASE, LISBON?
IT'S REALLY IMPORTANT.

518
00:26:43,123 --> 00:26:46,343
I NEED TO SEE YOU.
ALSO A BLUEBERRY MUFFIN.

519
00:27:04,231 --> 00:27:05,798
[grunts]

520
00:27:05,798 --> 00:27:08,452
LOOKS LIKE CRANBERRY.

521
00:27:08,452 --> 00:27:12,108
THEY DIDN'T HAVE ANY BLUEBERRY.
WHAT'S UP?

522
00:27:14,894 --> 00:27:17,461
[lowers voice]
RODDY GERBER'S INNOCENT.

523
00:27:17,461 --> 00:27:19,202
[lowers voice]
THAT'S IT?

524
00:27:19,202 --> 00:27:21,248
PRETTY MUCH. WELL, NO.

525
00:27:21,248 --> 00:27:24,251
RODDY BEAT UP KIRBY
SO HE'D TELL HIM

526
00:27:24,251 --> 00:27:26,166
WHERE THE, UH, PROTECTED
VULTURES WERE NESTING

527
00:27:26,166 --> 00:27:29,082
SO RODDY COULD KILL THEM, BUT HE
SAYS HE DIDN'T KILL KIRBY,

528
00:27:29,082 --> 00:27:31,650
AND I BELIEVE HIM.
HE SWORE ON HIS MOTHER'S GRAVE.

529
00:27:31,650 --> 00:27:33,173
THAT'S INTERESTING,

530
00:27:33,173 --> 00:27:35,871
BUT YOU COULD HAVE
TOLD ME THAT ON THE PHONE.

531
00:27:35,871 --> 00:27:39,266
I NEEDED A VISITOR SO I COULD
GET INTO THE VISITORS ROOM.

532
00:27:39,266 --> 00:27:41,616
HOW I WISH I HAD MY GUN.

533
00:27:41,616 --> 00:27:44,184
HEY, CRIME-FIGHTING'S HARD.
SUCK IT UP.

534
00:27:44,184 --> 00:27:46,708
[whispering] LOOK,
THAT'S WHY WE'RE HERE.

535
00:27:46,708 --> 00:27:49,276
DOOLEY GERBER?I NEED TO ASK HIM A QUESTION.

536
00:27:49,276 --> 00:27:51,757
WHAT QUESTION?ANY QUESTION.
IT DOESN'T MATTER.

537
00:27:51,757 --> 00:27:54,063
CAN YOU KEEP THE GUARD OFF ME?
COULD YOU, PLEASE?

538
00:27:54,063 --> 00:27:55,151
HEY.

539
00:27:55,151 --> 00:27:57,676
[normal voice] IT'S OKAY.

540
00:27:59,503 --> 00:28:01,201
[normal voice]
DOOLEY, YOU CAN TELL ME.

541
00:28:01,201 --> 00:28:04,160
THE TRUTH IS YOU KILLED YOUR
SON-IN-LAW. ISN'T THAT TRUE?

542
00:28:04,160 --> 00:28:07,207
AND WHO ARE YOU NOW?

543
00:28:07,207 --> 00:28:09,078
THAT'S A VERY GOOD ANSWER.

544
00:28:09,078 --> 00:28:10,950
THANK YOU.

545
00:28:15,737 --> 00:28:17,086
SO?

546
00:28:17,086 --> 00:28:18,392
WHAT'D YOU LEARN?

547
00:28:18,392 --> 00:28:21,090
WELL, THAT WAS
JUST A CONTROL QUESTION.

548
00:28:21,090 --> 00:28:24,833
THE NEXT QUESTION I ASK HIM
IS THE CRITICAL ONE.YOU KNOW WHAT?
I DON'T NEED MY GUN.

549
00:28:24,833 --> 00:28:26,835
I CAN JUST HIT YOU
WITH MY CHAIR.

550
00:28:26,835 --> 00:28:29,838
I THINK YOU'LL FIND IT'S BOLTED
TO THE FLOOR. [chuckles]

551
00:28:29,838 --> 00:28:31,840
DO YOU UNDERSTAND
WHAT'S HAPPENING TO YOU?

552
00:28:31,840 --> 00:28:33,799
YOU COULD GET
A PRISON SENTENCE.

553
00:28:33,799 --> 00:28:35,931
I UNDERSTAND THAT
YOU'RE KEEPING ME IN JAIL

554
00:28:35,931 --> 00:28:38,064
IN THE HOPES THAT YOU
WILL TEACH ME A LESSON.

555
00:28:38,064 --> 00:28:40,109
IT'S NOT GONNA WORK.

556
00:28:40,109 --> 00:28:43,243
I AM NOT KEEPING YOU IN JAIL.
THE LAW IS KEEPING YOU IN JAIL.

557
00:28:43,243 --> 00:28:45,288
THE LAW,
AS PLAYED BY SAM BOSCO,

558
00:28:45,288 --> 00:28:48,161
AND YOU CAN MAKE SAM BOSCO DO
ANYTHING WHENEVER YOU LIKE.

559
00:28:48,161 --> 00:28:51,251
RIGHT. BECAUSE HE'S
SO IN LOVE WITH ME,

560
00:28:51,251 --> 00:28:53,209
I CAN MAKE HIM DO WHATEVER.

561
00:28:53,209 --> 00:28:55,385
YES.

562
00:28:55,385 --> 00:28:58,606
NO. NO, I WAS ONLY SAYING THAT
BECAUSE THAT'S WHAT RIGSBY

563
00:28:58,606 --> 00:29:00,608
AND THE GUYS
WERE JUST SAYING.

564
00:29:00,608 --> 00:29:04,394
IT'S TOTAL NONSENSE. SAM BOSCO
IS A HAPPILY MARRIED MAN.

565
00:29:04,394 --> 00:29:07,223
HE HASN'T THE FAINTEST
INTEREST IN ME THAT WAY.

566
00:29:07,223 --> 00:29:09,225
I HAVE NO INFLUENCE
OVER HIM WHATSOEVER.

567
00:29:09,225 --> 00:29:12,054
THE GUYS NOTICED IT, TOO?
I'M IMPRESSED.

568
00:29:12,054 --> 00:29:14,622
HE'S VERY RECESSIVE
IN HIS PASSIONS.

569
00:29:14,622 --> 00:29:17,190
HARD TO SPOT THAT
HE'D KILL AND DIE FOR YOU.

570
00:29:17,190 --> 00:29:19,583
TRUST ME,
YOU ARE WAY OFF.

571
00:29:19,583 --> 00:29:21,585
INTERESTING PUZZLE
YOU PRESENT.

572
00:29:21,585 --> 00:29:25,633
LIES AND TRUTH
ALL MIXED TOGETHER.

573
00:29:25,633 --> 00:29:29,419
LOOK, I HOPE WE CAN GET YOU
OUT OF THIS MESS.

574
00:29:29,419 --> 00:29:33,206
BUT IT'S ALSO TRUE
THAT I DO HOPE THAT

575
00:29:33,206 --> 00:29:35,208
YOU LEARN A LESSON
FROM THIS.

576
00:29:35,208 --> 00:29:37,210
THERE ARE REAL BOUNDARIES
IN LIFE.

577
00:29:37,210 --> 00:29:39,255
THESE ARE REAL PRISON WALLS.

578
00:29:39,255 --> 00:29:42,781
[whispers] ONLY IN YOUR MIND,
LISBON. ONLY IN YOUR MIND.

579
00:30:36,443 --> 00:30:39,011
[man] Officer exiting six.

580
00:30:39,011 --> 00:30:43,015
[buzzer sounds]

581
00:30:43,015 --> 00:30:44,886
[door closes]

582
00:30:53,460 --> 00:30:56,202
[chittering]

583
00:30:56,202 --> 00:30:59,031
[squeaking]

584
00:31:35,284 --> 00:31:36,198
[squeaks]

585
00:31:51,300 --> 00:31:55,261
[bell ringing]

586
00:31:55,261 --> 00:31:57,219
[man] REC CENTER
BREAKFAST CALL.

587
00:31:57,219 --> 00:31:59,265
HEY, HELP! HEY, HELP!
HEY, DEPUTY!

588
00:31:59,265 --> 00:32:01,310
HEY, HEY, MAN,
WE GOT A MAN DOWN, MAN!

589
00:32:01,310 --> 00:32:05,227
HE AIN'T MOVING! DEPUTY, I GOT
A MAN DOWN! WE NEED HELP, MAN!

590
00:32:05,227 --> 00:32:09,014
OH, CRAP. WE HAVE
AN INMATE DOWN, LEVEL NINE.

591
00:32:09,014 --> 00:32:11,016
NUMBER EIGHT OUT LIKE A LIGHT.

592
00:32:11,016 --> 00:32:14,149
DID YOU DO THIS?NO, MAN,
I DIDN'T TOUCH HIM, MAN!

593
00:32:14,149 --> 00:32:16,021
HE JUST AIN'T MOVIN', MAN!

594
00:32:30,165 --> 00:32:32,428
'SUP WITH HIM?

595
00:32:32,428 --> 00:32:35,083
DAMNED IF I KNOW. HE WAS
LIKE THIS WHEN I GOT THERE.

596
00:32:35,083 --> 00:32:37,912
OKAY, LEAVE HIM HERE.
I'LL CALL THE MEDIC.

597
00:32:37,912 --> 00:32:39,958
YOU GUYS GO GET BACK ON POST.

598
00:32:44,092 --> 00:32:47,008
GOT A CUSTOMER FOR YOU.

599
00:32:47,008 --> 00:32:48,967
NO.

600
00:32:48,967 --> 00:32:51,708
OKAY.

601
00:32:51,708 --> 00:32:55,103
[man speaks indistinctly]

602
00:32:55,103 --> 00:32:56,975
[muttering indistinctly]

603
00:32:59,803 --> 00:33:02,110
WHAT ARE YOU SAYING?

604
00:33:02,110 --> 00:33:06,071
[whispers] MY HAND.

605
00:33:06,071 --> 00:33:08,638
HAND?

606
00:33:08,638 --> 00:33:09,988
[squeals]

607
00:33:13,643 --> 00:33:17,212
[voice breaking]
STEVE, COME QUICK.

608
00:33:17,212 --> 00:33:19,649
WE GOT A PROBLEM, STEVE.
I NEED HELP.

609
00:33:19,649 --> 00:33:21,390
I NEED HELP![buzzer blaring]

610
00:33:21,390 --> 00:33:24,654
HEY! HEY! NO, NO, NO![mouse squealing]

611
00:33:24,654 --> 00:33:26,656
HEY! SOMEONE! SOMEONE![banging on door]

612
00:33:26,656 --> 00:33:29,833
PRISONER LOOSE!
THERE'S A PRISONER LOOSE!

613
00:33:29,833 --> 00:33:31,009
HELP!

614
00:33:31,009 --> 00:33:33,011
HELP!

615
00:33:33,011 --> 00:33:35,056
HELP, SOMEONE!

616
00:33:35,056 --> 00:33:37,580
[buzzer continuing,
guard shouting indistinctly]

617
00:33:37,580 --> 00:33:40,061
MORNING.

618
00:33:40,061 --> 00:33:43,630
[man] HEY! HEY!

619
00:33:43,630 --> 00:33:46,546
HELP! SOMEBODY!

620
00:33:46,546 --> 00:33:48,548
HEY!

621
00:34:04,259 --> 00:34:07,697
LISBON,
I HAD A HORRIBLE DREAM.

622
00:34:07,697 --> 00:34:10,352
I DREAMT THAT JANE
ESCAPED THE COUNTY JAIL.

623
00:34:10,352 --> 00:34:13,094
I DREAMT THAT THE SHERIFF,
THE A.G. AND THE DISTRICT SUPER

624
00:34:13,094 --> 00:34:14,965
ALL CALLED TO YELL AT ME.

625
00:34:14,965 --> 00:34:18,708
NOW YOU'RE GONNA
WAKE ME UP, YES?

626
00:34:18,708 --> 00:34:21,407
I'M SORRY, SIR.
I HAVE NO EXCUSE FOR HIM.

627
00:34:21,407 --> 00:34:23,409
HE IS BEYOND OUT OF LINE.

628
00:34:23,409 --> 00:34:25,411
HE'S BLOWN IT, ALL RIGHT.

629
00:34:25,411 --> 00:34:27,456
WE HAVE AN A.P.B. OUT,

630
00:34:27,456 --> 00:34:30,329
BUT MAYBE YOU CAN CONTACT HIM,
PERSUADE HIM TO COME IN QUIETLY.

631
00:34:30,329 --> 00:34:35,334
NOBODY WANTS HIM TO GET HURT.CONTACT HIM HOW?
PERSUADE HIM HOW?

632
00:34:35,334 --> 00:34:37,466
YOU TWO ARE CLOSE.
HE'LL LISTEN TO YOU.

633
00:34:37,466 --> 00:34:39,816
THAT'S VERY FUNNY.WHAT IS IT FUNNY?

634
00:34:39,816 --> 00:34:42,689
IT JUST IS.[cell phone rings]

635
00:34:42,689 --> 00:34:45,170
[Patrick] Hi, Sam.

636
00:34:45,170 --> 00:34:47,346
WHERE ARE YOU?

637
00:34:47,346 --> 00:34:49,609
Dooley Gerber's house.

638
00:34:49,609 --> 00:34:52,307
IF YOU SEND THE SHERIFF OVER,
I'LL HAVE KIRBY'S KILLER

639
00:34:52,307 --> 00:34:56,398
IN TEN MINUTES OR SO.JANE, YOU DAMN FOOL!

640
00:34:56,398 --> 00:34:57,747
THANK YOU.

641
00:34:57,747 --> 00:34:59,749
WHAT THE HELL
ARE YOU TALKING ABOUT?

642
00:34:59,749 --> 00:35:02,535
YOU SAID YOU HAD
KIRBY'S KILLER.

643
00:35:02,535 --> 00:35:04,580
NOT YET, BUT I LIKE
TO BE AN OPTIMIST.

644
00:35:04,580 --> 00:35:07,366
YOU WOULDN'T HAVE THE MAKINGS
OF A CUP OF TEA, WOULD YOU?

645
00:35:07,366 --> 00:35:09,933
THANK YOU.

646
00:35:09,933 --> 00:35:10,804
YOU'RE WELCOME.

647
00:35:10,804 --> 00:35:13,589
MMM.

648
00:35:13,589 --> 00:35:17,115
SO LISTEN, UH, RODDY TOLD ME
ABOUT THE VULTURES

649
00:35:17,115 --> 00:35:21,075
AND WHAT HE DID TO KIRBY. HOW
DID YOU COPE WITH THAT, DONNA--

650
00:35:21,075 --> 00:35:23,904
YOUR HUSBAND BEING
BEATEN BY YOUR BROTHER?

651
00:35:23,904 --> 00:35:26,124
HOW DID YOU FEEL ABOUT THAT?

652
00:35:26,124 --> 00:35:27,603
ANGRY.

653
00:35:27,603 --> 00:35:28,778
WITH WHO?

654
00:35:28,778 --> 00:35:30,911
MYSELF, MY FAMILY.

655
00:35:30,911 --> 00:35:33,870
KIRBY WAS A GOOD MAN,
AND I LET HIM DOWN.OH, HON.

656
00:35:33,870 --> 00:35:35,959
NO. NO, DADDY, IT'S TRUE.
I LET THE MONEY BLIND ME.

657
00:35:35,959 --> 00:35:38,179
WE ALL DID.

658
00:35:38,179 --> 00:35:41,791
EXCUSE ME.
I GOT STUFF TO DO.OH, PLEASE DON'T GO,
SANDRINE.

659
00:35:41,791 --> 00:35:44,490
I WAS JUST GONNA SAY
HOW FUNNY IT IS WHEN YOU HAVE

660
00:35:44,490 --> 00:35:47,754
A BIG FAMILY FIGHT,
IT CAN CLARIFY A SITUATION.

661
00:35:47,754 --> 00:35:50,235
DO YOU THINK
THAT HAPPENED AT ALL?I WISH.

662
00:35:50,235 --> 00:35:52,280
MAYBE KIRBY FOUND CLARITY.

663
00:35:52,280 --> 00:35:55,240
MAYBE KIRBY REALIZED
HOW, UH, IMPORTANT IT WAS

664
00:35:55,240 --> 00:35:57,242
FOR HIM TO BE TRUTHFUL.

665
00:35:57,242 --> 00:36:00,288
WHEN WE FOUND POOR KIRBY,

666
00:36:00,288 --> 00:36:02,769
HE HAD SOME FLECKS
OF GLITTER ON HIS FACE.

667
00:36:02,769 --> 00:36:05,424
AND WHEN I SAW YOU, DOOLEY,
AT THE PRISON,

668
00:36:05,424 --> 00:36:08,470
YOU HAD SOME GLITTER
ON YOUR FACE, TOO,

669
00:36:08,470 --> 00:36:11,386
WHICH MEANS YOU AND KIRBY
WERE IN CLOSE CONTACT

670
00:36:11,386 --> 00:36:14,868
TO THE SAME WOMAN--A WOMAN
WHO LIKES TO WEAR GLITTER.

671
00:36:14,868 --> 00:36:17,087
THAT WOULD BE YOU, SANDRINE.

672
00:36:19,264 --> 00:36:21,266
YOU'RE STUPID.

673
00:36:21,266 --> 00:36:22,702
OFTEN.

674
00:36:22,702 --> 00:36:27,446
BUT I NOW ALSO SEE THAT
NEITHER DOOLEY NOR DONNA

675
00:36:27,446 --> 00:36:31,493
HAD ANY NOTION OF THIS
CONNECTION BETWEEN YOU AND HE,

676
00:36:31,493 --> 00:36:34,931
WHICH MEANS KIRBY
WAS VERY CONSIDERATE...

677
00:36:34,931 --> 00:36:37,760
WHAT?CONSIDERATE ENOUGH TO WARN YOU
BEFORE HE CAME CLEAN

678
00:36:37,760 --> 00:36:39,675
ABOUT YOUR AFFAIR.

679
00:36:39,675 --> 00:36:42,852
[chuckles] OH, BABY, I SWEAR
ON MY LIFE THERE WAS NO AFFAIR.

680
00:36:42,852 --> 00:36:45,333
SURE THERE WAS. YOU WERE
BORED AND FRUSTRATED.

681
00:36:45,333 --> 00:36:48,380
HE WAS AVAILABLE.NO, NO, NO.

682
00:36:48,380 --> 00:36:51,165
KIRBY SOON FOUND OUT
WHAT KIND OF WOMAN YOU ARE,

683
00:36:51,165 --> 00:36:54,299
AND HE BROKE IT OFF, YES?
HE WANTED TO GET OUT

684
00:36:54,299 --> 00:36:57,302
OF SUTTER VALLEY. HE WANTED TO
START A NEW LIFE WITH HIS WIFE,

685
00:36:57,302 --> 00:36:58,564
THE WOMAN THAT
HE ACTUALLY DID LOVE.

686
00:36:58,564 --> 00:37:00,522
BUT FIRST HE FELT COMPELLED

687
00:37:00,522 --> 00:37:04,265
TO HAVE TO TELL
EVERYBODY THE TRUTH, THE FOOL.

688
00:37:04,265 --> 00:37:07,834
HE WAS GONNA RUIN YOUR LIFE
OVER WHAT--SOME BIRDS?

689
00:37:07,834 --> 00:37:10,010
FOR A BEATING THAT
HE POSSIBLY DESERVED?

690
00:37:10,010 --> 00:37:12,795
WHY WOULD HE DO THAT?
YOU BEGGED HIM NOT TO TELL.

691
00:37:12,795 --> 00:37:15,842
YOU BEGGED HIM,
AND HE JUST WOULDN'T LISTEN.

692
00:37:15,842 --> 00:37:18,410
THIS IS ALL A LIE.

693
00:37:18,410 --> 00:37:21,064
THAT NEVER HAPPENED.

694
00:37:21,064 --> 00:37:26,505
YEAH, YOU HAD TO KILL HIM
RIGHT THERE AND THEN.NO! NO! IT'S A LIE.
IT'S A LIE.

695
00:37:26,505 --> 00:37:29,943
I'M SORRY, SANDRINE, BUT WE HAVE
CONCLUSIVE FORENSIC EVIDENCE

696
00:37:29,943 --> 00:37:32,032
FROM OUR BOYS AT THE CRIME LAB.

697
00:37:32,032 --> 00:37:35,905
THE GLITTER ON KIRBY'S FACE
COVERED IN YOUR D.N.A.--COVERED.

698
00:37:35,905 --> 00:37:38,865
AND D.N.A. DOESN'T LIE.

699
00:37:38,865 --> 00:37:42,695
[voice trembling] I DON'T KNOW
WHERE THAT CAME FROM,

700
00:37:42,695 --> 00:37:44,044
'CAUSE IT WASN'T ME.

701
00:37:44,044 --> 00:37:45,959
POLICE ARE ON THEIR WAY,
SANDRINE.

702
00:37:45,959 --> 00:37:48,918
I WOULD BE HONEST
WITH YOUR FAMILY,

703
00:37:48,918 --> 00:37:51,791
'CAUSE YOU MAY NOT SEE THEM
FOR A WHILE.[siren wailing]

704
00:37:53,880 --> 00:37:55,185
SANDRINE.

705
00:37:55,185 --> 00:37:57,231
SANDRINE. SANDRINE!

706
00:37:57,231 --> 00:38:00,060
OH, PLEASE!TELL ME THAT IT ISN'T TRUE.
JUST TELL ME.

707
00:38:00,060 --> 00:38:02,845
HE MADE ME DO IT.[gasps]

708
00:38:02,845 --> 00:38:05,848
HE MADE YOU DO IT, HUH?NO, HE--HE MADE ME DO IT!

709
00:38:05,848 --> 00:38:08,198
[Patrick] SHE'LL--
SHE'LL HAVE HER PUNISHMENT.NOT ENOUGH!

710
00:38:08,198 --> 00:38:09,591
AAH! OHH.

711
00:38:09,591 --> 00:38:12,202
[siren bleeps]

712
00:38:15,684 --> 00:38:18,600
[voice amplified] PATRICK JANE,
WE KNOW YOU'RE IN THERE.

713
00:38:18,600 --> 00:38:20,472
COME OUT WITH YOUR HANDS UP.

714
00:38:23,953 --> 00:38:26,173
UH, YES, IT'S ME
THEY'RE AFTER, NOT YOU.

715
00:38:26,173 --> 00:38:29,829
AND THERE IS
NO D.N.A. EVIDENCE EITHER.

716
00:38:29,829 --> 00:38:33,093
THAT SCIENTIFIC, FORENSIC STUFF,
IT'S--IT'S ALL VERY OVERRATED.

717
00:38:33,093 --> 00:38:35,791
THANK YOU FOR THE TEA.BUT WE--

718
00:38:35,791 --> 00:38:38,838
NO TAKE-BACKS.BUT YOU JUST--

719
00:38:38,838 --> 00:38:40,709
AH, AH. WHOOP.

720
00:38:42,842 --> 00:38:44,931
I'M COMING!

721
00:38:51,546 --> 00:38:53,983
OW.

722
00:38:53,983 --> 00:38:55,942
BYE.

723
00:38:55,942 --> 00:38:57,770
[police radio chatter]

724
00:38:57,770 --> 00:38:59,772
THANK YOU.

725
00:38:59,772 --> 00:39:01,643
WHOOPS.

726
00:39:05,952 --> 00:39:08,955
SO...

727
00:39:08,955 --> 00:39:11,827
SO...

728
00:39:11,827 --> 00:39:14,830
JANE GOT A CONFESSION
FROM SANDRINE GERBER.

729
00:39:14,830 --> 00:39:16,745
CASE CLOSED.

730
00:39:16,745 --> 00:39:19,008
YEAH, THE A.G.
LIKELY WON'T MAKE IT STICK,

731
00:39:19,008 --> 00:39:23,273
WHAT WITH HIS KEY WITNESS
BEING IN JAIL HIMSELF--

732
00:39:23,273 --> 00:39:27,887
IN FOR A GOOD, LONG SPELL ONCE
YOU ADD IN THE ESCAPE CHARGES.

733
00:39:27,887 --> 00:39:30,716
THAT'S WHAT I WANTED
TO TALK TO YOU ABOUT.

734
00:39:30,716 --> 00:39:32,935
I THOUGHT THIS WOULD
TEACH JANE A LESSON.

735
00:39:32,935 --> 00:39:36,374
I THOUGHT HE'D BACK DOWN
OR APOLOGIZE, BUT HE DIDN'T,

736
00:39:36,374 --> 00:39:39,768
AND NOW IT'S GONE TOO FAR.
YOU GOTTA LET HIM GO.

737
00:39:39,768 --> 00:39:42,641
IF YOU DROP THE CHARGES,
THE A.G. WON'T CHASE IT.

738
00:39:42,641 --> 00:39:48,473
WHAT IF I DON'T WANT
TO DO THAT?

739
00:39:48,473 --> 00:39:51,737
DON'T MAKE ME GO THERE,
SAM.

740
00:39:54,740 --> 00:39:57,395
WHAT ARE YOU SAYING,
EXACTLY?

741
00:39:57,395 --> 00:39:59,832
YOU KNOW WHAT I'M SAYING.

742
00:39:59,832 --> 00:40:03,749
I'LL TALK ABOUT WHAT HAPPENED
EIGHT YEARS AGO.

743
00:40:06,969 --> 00:40:09,407
YOU'D GO THERE?

744
00:40:09,407 --> 00:40:11,191
REALLY?

745
00:40:11,191 --> 00:40:13,236
I DON'T BELIEVE YOU.

746
00:40:13,236 --> 00:40:16,283
BELIEVE ME. HERE I AM.

747
00:40:20,592 --> 00:40:23,421
YOU WOULD RUIN OUR LIVES,

748
00:40:23,421 --> 00:40:25,379
OURCAREERS,

749
00:40:25,379 --> 00:40:27,512
OVER JANE?

750
00:40:27,512 --> 00:40:29,905
DOES HE MEAN
THAT MUCH TO YOU?

751
00:40:29,905 --> 00:40:31,994
HE CLOSES CASES.

752
00:40:31,994 --> 00:40:34,954
"HE CLOSES CASES."

753
00:40:34,954 --> 00:40:36,825
IS THAT ALL IT IS?

754
00:40:42,222 --> 00:40:45,355
I'M TELLING YOU IF YOU DON'T
LET JANE GO, I'LL TALK.

755
00:40:45,355 --> 00:40:48,837
THAT'S ALL.

756
00:40:48,837 --> 00:40:52,754
WHAT ARE YOU GONNA DO?

757
00:40:59,935 --> 00:41:01,937
YEAH, OKAY, YOU DID GOOD.

758
00:41:01,937 --> 00:41:04,331
BUT THERE'S TWO THINGS
PUZZLING ME.YEAH?

759
00:41:04,331 --> 00:41:06,333
HOW DID YOU GET
OUT OF JAIL,

760
00:41:06,333 --> 00:41:08,814
AND HOW DID YOU GET
A CHANGE OF CLOTHES?

761
00:41:08,814 --> 00:41:10,772
AH, WELL, I'M GLAD
YOU ASKED THAT QUESTION.

762
00:41:10,772 --> 00:41:12,992
IT WAS VERY... HEY, LISBON.HEY.

763
00:41:12,992 --> 00:41:14,950
SIMPLE.SO THEY LET YOU OUT, THEN?

764
00:41:14,950 --> 00:41:18,824
YES, UH, THEY DID.
THANK YOU VERY MUCH.NOTHING TO DO WITH ME.

765
00:41:18,824 --> 00:41:20,303
SO MODEST.

766
00:41:20,303 --> 00:41:22,871
AH, RIGHT.
BOSCO'S SO IN LOVE WITH ME,

767
00:41:22,871 --> 00:41:25,004
HE'LL DO WHATEVER I SAY.

768
00:41:25,004 --> 00:41:28,660
YES. YEAH,
IT'S A LITTLE FAR-FETCHED.

769
00:41:28,660 --> 00:41:31,706
HE DOES LOVE YOU.
HOW COULD HE NOT?

770
00:41:31,706 --> 00:41:35,710
BUT HE'S NOT THE TYPE TO BEND
HIS PRINCIPLES OVER LOVE.

771
00:41:35,710 --> 00:41:38,626
SO I FIGURE
IT'S SOMETHING MORE CONCRETE.

772
00:41:38,626 --> 00:41:40,976
YOU MUST HAVE
SOMETHING ON HIM.YOU THINK?

773
00:41:40,976 --> 00:41:45,067
YES, SOMETHING HE DID WRONG,

774
00:41:45,067 --> 00:41:47,461
SOMETHING VERY BAD
THAT YOU KNOW ABOUT.

775
00:41:47,461 --> 00:41:49,898
NOW HE'S NOT THE TYPE
TO STEAL OR DO DRUGS,

776
00:41:49,898 --> 00:41:52,814
SO MY GUESS--HE HURT SOMEONE.

777
00:41:54,773 --> 00:41:56,601
HE KILLED 'EM.

778
00:41:56,601 --> 00:41:59,125
HE KILLED A BAD GUY THAT HE
COULDN'T CATCH ANY OTHER WAY.

779
00:41:59,125 --> 00:42:00,605
NO.

780
00:42:00,605 --> 00:42:02,781
YES, AND YOU
HELPED HIM DO IT.

781
00:42:02,781 --> 00:42:05,784
NO--YOU FOUND OUT
AFTER THE FACT,

782
00:42:05,784 --> 00:42:09,439
AND YOU...
LET HIM OFF THE HOOK

783
00:42:09,439 --> 00:42:12,181
BECAUSE THE BAD GUY
DESERVED IT.

784
00:42:12,181 --> 00:42:14,444
NO.

785
00:42:14,444 --> 00:42:17,970
I'M TOUCHED THAT YOU WOULD
RISK YOUR CAREER OVER ME.

786
00:42:17,970 --> 00:42:19,972
THAT MEANS A LOT TO ME.

787
00:42:19,972 --> 00:42:23,062
IF YOU'RE RIGHT,
AND I'M NOT SAYING YOU ARE,

788
00:42:23,062 --> 00:42:26,152
IT WOULD MEAN I BROKE
THE TRUST OF SOMEBODY

789
00:42:26,152 --> 00:42:28,850
I RESPECT AND ADMIRE
FOR YOUR SAKE.

790
00:42:28,850 --> 00:42:31,287
IF IT IS TRUE,
I WOULD HOPE IN THE FUTURE

791
00:42:31,287 --> 00:42:34,029
YOU'D BE A LITTLE BIT MORE
MATURE AND RESPONSIBLE

792
00:42:34,029 --> 00:42:35,857
IN YOUR BEHAVIOR.

793
00:42:35,857 --> 00:42:38,947
I'M GRATEFUL AND ALL THAT,
BUT LET'S NOT GO CRAZY HERE.

794
00:42:38,947 --> 00:42:41,167
I SHOULD HAVE
LET YOU ROT IN JAIL.

795
00:42:48,696 --> 00:42:51,481
STAY TUNED FOR SCENES
FROM OUR NEXT EPISODE.

